    "summary": "Portrait of a young woman; single-page painting mounted on album folio. A young woman stands holding a glass to her lips. In her other hand she holds a decanter-shaped glass bottle with frosted decoration. She wears an open dark red flowered jacket, a green blouse and a saffron skirt. Her head-dress consists of a feather and jewels attached to a band from which a light blue veil falls. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes.\r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
